   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The New York Stock Exchange welcomes OneConnect (NYSE: OCFT) in celebration of its listing. Wangchun Ye, CEO, and Sin Yin Tan, Director, joined by John Tuttle, NYSE Vice Chairman and Chief Commercial Officer, rings the NYSE Opening Bell¬Æ.</rdf:li>
